# Publisher PDFs of cited papers. This remote is PUBLIC, and the papers are not
# ours to redistribute -- cite the DOI in the README instead of committing the
# file. Keep the PDF locally if you need it; it just stays untracked. The rule is
# deliberately repo-wide rather than per-folder, because it has now been needed
# twice (activity_striatum, then cortical_correlations).
**/*.pdf
# docs/stream_demo is a committed snapshot: its figures and measured numbers
# are part of the document, so they are exempt from the *.png / *.json rules
!docs/stream_demo/figures/*.png
!docs/stream_demo/results.json
!docs/stream_demo/bench.json
